Errors and corrections:
1. Comment should start with // not /
2. Public should be public (lowercase).
3. Missing void return type: public static void main.
4. Argument name should be args (or any name) but type String[] is correct; missing []? Actually String[] a is fine, but conventionally args. Not an error.
5. Character literal 'Welcome' should be string "Welcome".
6. Missing semicolon after System.out.print("Nice ").
7. Program should be in quotes: "Program".
Corrected code:
// Try to find the errors
public class Test1 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Welcome");
        System.out.println("to");
        System.out.println("TM105");
        System.out.print("Nice ");
        System.out.println("Program");
    }
}
Output:
Welcome
to
TM105
Nice Program
